All mandatory local gates pass: zero hits in 200,000 structure-aware guesses, four attacks at 0/8, the exact reference at 8/8, doubled-size construction valid, and 40/40 relabelling/symmetry checks. The bare oracle loop is now running from `easy`; I’ll use its actual held rung as the shipping preset and will inspect every failed parse before accepting the verdict.
