The full output contract is working: both successful `easy` replies parsed and verified rather than exploiting a parser miss. The run has advanced to `medium` (45 mixed cards); no retuning is being done between oracle attempts.
diff --git a/gen_2205_13905.py b/gen_2205_13905.py
